{'symbol': 'BAC', 'date': '2023-03-08 10:00:00', 'title': 'THE BFM FUND RECEIVES EQUITY INVESTMENT FROM BANK OF AMERICA', 'text': "SEED-STAGE\xa0PORTLAND AND VIRGINIA-BASED VENTURE FUND RUN BY WOMEN OF COLOR LEADERSHIP TEAM FOCUSED ON BLACK FOUNDERS \xa0TO ADVANCE ECONOMIC EQUITY ACROSS MULTIPLE VERTICALS WITHIN THE UNITED STATES; CURRENT PORTFOLIO INCLUDES START-UPS FROM SERENA WILLIAMS, ALLYSON FELIX, AND HBO'S 'INSECURE' PORTLAND, ORE. , MARCH 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BFM FUND (BLACK FOUNDERS MATTER), A PORTLAND-BASED, SEED-STAGE VENTURE FUND FOCUSED ON BLACK AND INNOVATIVE FOUNDERS, IS SLATED TO RECEIVE INVESTMENT FROM BANK OF AMERICA."}